{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-404209-r4518190","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Warm Black Bean Salad with Kale and Tomatoes","sourcePageId":404209,"sourceRevision":"4518190","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:15:51Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Warm%20Black%20Bean%20Salad%20with%20Kale%20and%20Tomatoes&oldid=4518190","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:29:22.049Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for salad","Category:Recipes from Foodista","Category:Recipes using black bean","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using ground cumin","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using tomato","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegan recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"d89a6e7ff82c74ad8e781f1c0fe495fbe12ce694ca409ea4f171ef4436858687","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Salad recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n| Image = [[File:Warm Black Bean Salad with Kale and Tomatoes.jpg|300px]]\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n[http://www.foodista.com/recipe/Z44TBCXS/warm-black-bean-salad-with-kale-and-tomatoes Originally posted to Foodista] by user Sharon Chen. Foodista recipes are released under a [http://www.foodista.com/static/legal CC-BY license].\n\n==Ingredients==\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n*1 medium yellow [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]] (about 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]])\n*4 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]]\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste\n*2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] [[Cookbook:Chiles|chile]] powder\n*1 teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Cumin|cumin]]\n*½ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n*2 cans (30 ounces) [[Cookbook:Black Bean|black beans]], undrained\n*4 cups firmly-packed [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Kale|kale]]\n*1 cup fresh diced [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomato]]\n*Juice of 1 [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]]\n*White [[Cookbook:Sesame Seed|sesame seeds]] for [[Cookbook:Garnish|garnishing]] (optional)\n\n==Preparation==\n#In a medium [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], heat oil over medium heat for 2–3 minutes. Add onion, garlic, and a [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of salt into the pan. Cook and stir 2–3 minutes or until onion is tender.\n#Stir in chili powder, cumin, cinnamon, and black beans with their liquid. Cook 2 minutes; mash the beans with the back of your spatula, leaving some beans intact.\n#Reduce heat to low; add kale, cook and stir 2–3 minutes or until kale is tender and mixture has thickened. Stir in lemon juice and tomato; taste and add more salt if desired.\n#Garnish with white sesame seeds.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using black bean]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes from Foodista]]\n[[Category:Recipes with images]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cumin]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Warm Black Bean Salad with Kale and Tomatoes","na